              "text": "ಇದು ಏಕಮುಖ ರಸ್ತೆ, ಆ ಕಡೆಯಿಂದ ಬರಬಾರದು. idu ēkamukha raste, ā kaḍeyinda barabāradu. This is a one-way road; nobody may come from that side."
            },
